k rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> › <a href=\"/zh/surah/88.html\">章 Al-Ghaashiya</a> › 节 22</nav><h1>经注： 章 Al-Ghaashiya 88:22</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿لَّسْتَ عَلَيْهِم بِمُصَيْطِرٍ﴾</p><section><h3>意义翻译</h3><p class=\"tr\">你绝不是监察他们的，</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Chinese Translation - Muhammad Makeen — v1.0.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">两位伊玛目的话以阿拉伯语原文逐字呈现，并附出处。</p><section><h2>伊斯兰谢赫 伊本·泰米叶</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">لم ينف كونه مع التذكير مبشرا وهاديا وداعيا.<cite>«الرد على السبكي في مسألة تعليق الطلاق» 1/466</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>伊玛目 伊本·盖伊姆</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا من المنقطع لا بالاعتبار الذي ذكره ابن خروف من كون المستثنى جملة مستقلة بل باعتبار آخر وهو أنه ليس المراد إثبات السيطرة على الكفار فإن الله سبحانه بعثه نذيرا مبلغا لرسالات ربه فمن أطاعة فله الجنة ومن عصاه فله النار<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote><h3>他引述他人的说法</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">المفسرون</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «المعنى أنك لم ترسل مسلطا عليهم قاهرا لهم جبارا كالملوك بل أنت عبدي ورسولي المبلغ رسالاتي فمن أطاعك فله الجنة ومن عصاك فله النار»<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=zh#s88a22\">在互动经注中打开（完整原文）</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/zh/ayah/88-21.html\">上一节 (88:21)</a><a href=\"/zh/ayah/88-23.html\">下一节 (88:23)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>两位谢赫经注汇编 · <a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">关于项目</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">隐私与条款</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/88-23.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>经注： Al-Ghaashiya 88:23 — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"但谁转身离去而且不信教，\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/88-23.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"经注： Al-Ghaashiya 88:23 — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"但谁转身离去而且不信教，\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> › <a href=\"/zh/surah/88.html\">章 Al-Ghaashiya</a> › 节 23</nav><h1>经注： 章 Al-Ghaashiya 88:23</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِلَّا مَن تَوَلَّىٰ وَكَفَرَ﴾</p><section><h3>意义翻译</h3><p class=\"tr\">但谁转身离去而且不信教，</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Chinese Translation - Muhammad Makeen — v1.0.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">两位伊玛目的话以阿拉伯语原文逐字呈现，并附出处。</p><section><h2>伊玛目 伊本·盖伊姆</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فهذا من المنقطع لا بالاعتبار الذي ذكره ابن خروف من كون المستثنى جملة مستقلة بل باعتبار آخر وهو أنه ليس المراد إثبات السيطرة على الكفار<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ويوضح هذا أن المخاطبين بهذا الخطاب هم الكفار فلا يصح أن يكونوا هم المستثنين.<cite>«بدائع الفوائد» 3/69</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=zh#s88a23\">在互动经注中打开（完整原文）</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/zh/ayah/88-22.html\">上一节 (88:22)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>两位谢赫经注汇编 · <a href=\"/zh/\">首页</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">关于项目</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">隐私与条款</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","surah/88.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>经注： 章 Al-Ghaashiya — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆的解释</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"经注： 章 Al-Ghaashiya — 伊本·泰米叶与伊本·盖伊姆论《古兰经》的意义\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/surah/88.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirsha